  m_text: 'Tamne te taste pan nahi malse. Navsari ni vaat aj alag hati. Tyanu paani,
    tyani hawa, thayu cooking. Aa toh bas tyaj bane, biju kyay nahi.

    <size=30>
    (You''ll never get that taste here. The food in Navsari was something else -the
    air, the water, the way it was cooked. This can only be made there, nowhere else.)</size>'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c4392fa2587efa49a69e986761ad8ea, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: -7760871754599387031, guid: 9c4392fa2587efa49a69e986761ad8ea, type: 2}
