    in Mumbai - one of the six sacred seasonal festivals in the Zoroastrian calendar,
    celebrated during the mid-winter solstice.
  - "She spots everyone she hasn\u2019t seen in months: neighbors, family friends,
    and familiar faces from years gone by. Everyone sits together in long rows, sharing
    the exact same meal."
  delayBetweenStories: 5
  skipRichTextTags: 1
  isPaused: 0
  useAudio: 0
  volume: 0.3
  AudioTypping: {fileID: 0}
