      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "As she and her children take their places at the long table,\nthe Gahambar
    food fills her plate: <i>saria, gajar mewa nu\nachar, roti, aalo boti, pulao,
    custard, and patra ni machi</i>.\r\n\r\nBut the moment her favorite <i>bhaji
    dana ma gosht</i> is served,\nshe tells her children.\r"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9c4392fa2587efa49a69e986761ad8ea, type: 2}
